## Exact next work and unchanged boundary

The next successor is the controller-owned process composition. It must create
the dedicated broker, worker and guardian children; construct an exact
inherited-FD close matrix; hand off and adopt the listener; drop and seal the
worker; verify READY before arming guardian v2; transport aggregate ledger
reservations before each CONTINUE; receive CONSUMED; terminate on every
ambiguous path; and reap broker and worker through generation-bound pidfds.

That composition must structurally guarantee one writer and no extra packet on
the release channel—it cannot infer exclusivity from socket metadata. After it
passes local synthetic tests, the remaining Gate-5 sequence is frozen full-size
bootstrap/lifecycle integration, successor source-closure authentication, a
separately authorized bounded Linux native qualification, and unchanged
host/input/resource/real-import admission.

GPU is still unnecessary. The S3-backed pretrained checkpoint remains the
intended base, but no remote availability check was made in this successor.
Real import, training and production remain disabled.
